        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin Estates Interior Latch</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLatches for use with <a href=\"/collections/baldwin-estates-door-lever-sets\"><b>Baldwin Estates Levers</b></a> or <a href=\"/collections/baldwin-estates-door-knob-sets\"><b>Baldwin Estates Knobs</b></a> sets.  Available in Passage (Hall/Closet) or Privacy (Bed/Bath) function and in 2 3/8\" or 2 3/4\" backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of Baldwin 55xx Latches:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hub Rotation 28 degrees for easy turning</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Head features anti-friction insert for smooth operation</li>\r\n<li>Latches have a 1/2\" throw</li>\r\n<li>Latch Bolts are non-handed </li>\r\n<li>Fully adjustable fronts for use on beveled doors</li>\r\n<li>Lever strength latches manufactured with heavy duty springs</li>\r\n<li>Supplied with 1\" (25mm) face plate</li>\r\n<li>Includes Standard Box T-Strike</li>\r\n<li>Includes Wood Fasteners and Template</li>\r\n<li>Includes Dust Box - 55100</li>\r\n<li>Includes 3.5\" Spindle</li>\r\n<li>Privacy Button included with Privacy Latches</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>For doors thicker than 1 3/4\" or use with escutcheon plates, a longer spindle is needed</b></p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Baldwin Estates Interior Latch, BAL-55xx",
                "description": "Latches for use with Baldwin Estates Levers or Baldwin Estates Knobs sets.  Available in Passage (Hall/Closet) or Privacy (Bed/Bath) function and in 2 3/8 or 2 3/4  backset.",
